[PrintTextModified Text:在投票中被选为【魔女】的，<br>是艾玛。|#0104Adv13_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛能听到一阵扑通扑通的响声，<br>那是心脏激烈跳动的声音。|#0104Adv13_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么回事，怎么会变成这样，我……杀了亚里沙……？）|#0104Adv13_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我会，被处刑……？）|#0104Adv13_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆泣きながら

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，呜呜……|#0104Adv13_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么办，怎么办，怎么办……！）|#0104Adv13_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛顿时觉得天旋地转，视野里的一切逐渐扭曲。<br>一切来得太突然，<br>她吓得双脚颤抖个不停。|#0104Adv13_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

