[PrintTextModified Text:看守抱住了艾玛<br>因恐惧而摇摇欲坠的身体。|#0104Adv13_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住、住手啊……|#0104Adv13_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的挣扎在看守面前十分无力。<br>看守拖着她往处刑台走去。|#0104Adv13_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛看向在场的每一名少女，<br>但所有人都把头扭开了。|#0104Adv13_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要……|#0104Adv13_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我看看，选哪个处刑台呢……<br>樱羽艾玛小姐，樱羽艾玛小姐……|#0104Adv13_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:差点把这给忘了，<br>所以这次就选这个吧——嘿咻。|#0104Adv13_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 歯車がまわる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_36 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:齿轮开始旋转，<br>中央的台座被缓缓替换。|#0104Adv13_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不管她怎样手脚并用地挣扎，就算发出恐惧的哀号，<br>大喊着我不想死，我不是魔女，<br>看守也依然紧紧地押住艾玛。|#0104Adv13_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（一切全完了）|#0104Adv13_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:扑通。心脏重重地跳动了一下。|#0104Adv13_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

